# Keep text files LF-normalized across platforms (whois repo convention).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Raw byte captures (OEM console dumps such as the B2 probe10 directory listing) must round-trip
# byte-exactly: the evidence bundle hashes the stored bytes in MANIFEST.md / SHA256SUMS.txt, so
# end-of-line normalisation would break verification on a fresh clone.
*.raw.txt -text
